{
  "backend_timeout_ms": 58000,
  "camel_example": "aliyun dataworks-public ListNodes --region cn-hangzhou --ProjectId 12345",
  "cmd_full_name": "dataworks-public list-nodes",
  "cmd_name": "list-nodes",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Retrieves a list of data development nodes with paging. You can also perform a filtered query on the list by using specified conditions",
  "description_zh": "分页获取数据开发节点列表，也可以通过筛选条件对列表进行筛选查询",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dataworks-public list-nodes --project-id 12345 --api-version 2024-05-18 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "ListNodes",
  "operation": {
    "action": "ListNodes",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2024-05-18",
    "method": "GET",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "list",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "12345",
      "help_en": "The ID of the DataWorks workspace. You can log on to the DataWorks console (https://workbench.data.aliyun.com/console) and go to the Workspace Management page to obtain the workspace ID",
      "help_zh": "DataWorks工作空间的ID。您可以登录DataWorks控制台 (https://workbench.data.aliyun.com/console)，进入工作空间配置页面获取工作空间ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "project_id",
      "options": [
        "--project-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ProjectId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "DataworksProject",
      "help_en": "The scenario to which the node belongs. This parameter is used as a filter condition. If you do not specify this parameter, leave it empty. In Data Studio, this parameter corresponds to the partitions in the left-side directory tree. Valid values: \n\nDataworksProject: project directory.\n\nDataworksManualWorkflow: manual workflow. \n\nDataworksManualTask: manual task",
      "help_zh": "筛选条件：节点所在场景，如未指定则不填写，在数据开发中对应左侧目录树的分区可选值： \n\nDataworksProject 项目目录\n\nDataworksManualWorkflow 手动工作流 \n\nDataworksManualTask 手动任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "scene",
      "options": [
        "--scene"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Scene",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "860438872620113XXXX",
      "help_en": "The ID of the container. This parameter is used as a filter condition to query nodes in a specified container. If you do not specify this parameter, leave it empty. This parameter is independent of the ResourceGroupId parameter.\n\n<notice>Before SDK version 8.0.0, this field is of the Long type. In SDK version 8.0.0 and later, this field is of the String type. This change does not affect the normal use of the SDK, and the parameter is still returned based on the type defined in the SDK. However, if you upgrade the SDK across version 8.0.0, the type change may cause project compilation failures. In this case, you must manually correct the data type.></notice>",
      "help_zh": "如未指定则不填写，筛选条件：在指定容器内。填写容器ID，与资源组（ResourceGroupId）无关。\n\n<notice>该字段在SDK8.0.0版本之前为Long类型，SDK8.0.0版本及之后为String类型。该变更不影响SDK正常使用，参数仍会按SDK中定义的类型返回。只有在跨8.0.0版本的SDK升级时，类型变更可能会导致项目编译不通过，需要用户手动修正数据类型。></notice>",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "container_id",
      "options": [
        "--container-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ContainerId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Normal",
      "help_en": "The scheduling type. This parameter is used as a filter condition. Valid values: \n\nNormal: The node runs as expected.\n\nPause: The node is paused, and the execution of its downstream nodes is blocked.\n \nSkip: The node is set to dry run. The system directly returns a success response with an execution duration of 0 seconds. This does not block the execution of downstream nodes or consume resources",
      "help_zh": "筛选条件：调度类型可选值： \n\nNormal：正常执行任务。\n\nPause：节点状态被置为暂停，并且会阻塞依赖当前节点的下游节点执行。\n \nSkip：节点状态被置为空跑，系统会直接返回成功（执行时长为0秒），不会阻塞下游节点执行，也不会占用资源",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "recurrence",
      "options": [
        "--recurrence"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Recurrence",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Allowed",
      "help_en": "The rerun mode. If you do not specify this parameter, leave it empty. Valid values: \n\nAllowed: The node can be rerun regardless of whether it is successfully run or fails to run.\n \nFailureAllowed: The node can be rerun only after it fails to run.\n \nDenied: The node cannot be rerun regardless of whether it is successfully run or fails to run",
      "help_zh": "重跑属性，如不指定则不填写。取值如下： \n\nAllowed：运行成功或失败后皆可重跑。\n \nFailureAllowed：运行成功后不可重跑，运行失败后可以重跑。\n \nDenied：运行成功或失败皆不可重跑",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "rerun_mode",
      "options": [
        "--rerun-mode"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RerunMode",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "test",
